WEBVTT

01:27.745 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:34.105 --> 01:35.185
Father,

01:35.265 --> 01:36.465
what if His Majesty told her

01:36.545 --> 01:39.185
that Mr. Li Lu went to his death willingly
on your orders?

01:40.665 --> 01:42.585
He would never spell it out.

01:43.745 --> 01:46.585
And I'm doing this for the Ling clan too.

01:46.665 --> 01:47.705
Even so,

01:47.785 --> 01:49.985
aren't you afraid
that once Young Lady learns the truth,

01:50.505 --> 01:51.945
she won't be able to bear it?

01:56.065 --> 01:58.305
She's a daughter of the Ling clan.

01:59.345 --> 02:02.905
There are things she has to endure!

02:02.985 --> 02:06.425
And for all that she's the Empress,

02:06.505 --> 02:07.985
in the end,

02:08.545 --> 02:10.905
the Ling clan's what she leans on.

02:10.985 --> 02:13.145
Only if the Ling clan stands strong

02:13.225 --> 02:14.545
can she be safe.

02:15.065 --> 02:16.665
At court now,

02:17.265 --> 02:19.625
Xiao Huan is closing in on me
at every turn.

02:20.225 --> 02:22.825
If I lose the backing
of the senior ministers,

02:22.905 --> 02:26.225
I'll hardly be able to stand.

02:26.745 --> 02:27.665
So,

02:28.985 --> 02:32.065
Cangcang must bear a prince
as soon as she can.

02:32.145 --> 02:34.145
Any news of the Saintess
of the Lingbi Sect?

02:34.225 --> 02:35.665
Finding her

02:37.625 --> 02:40.985
is the key to winning back Moon-Eclipse.

02:42.985 --> 02:45.625
I will give my all,
even at the cost of my life!

03:04.105 --> 03:05.905
It fears my Begonia Pendant!

03:06.705 --> 03:08.945
This pendant must hold Wanwei Herb.

03:09.465 --> 03:10.945
It's a rare medicinal herb.

03:11.465 --> 03:14.265
When it senses poison,
it glows and drives the poison away.

03:15.705 --> 03:18.785
With it on you, no toxin can hurt you.

03:23.585 --> 03:25.105
Moon-Eclipse is the Ghost King's token.

03:26.105 --> 03:27.665
It feeds on Wanwei Herb

03:27.745 --> 03:29.545
and is born among it.

03:30.305 --> 03:31.865
Planted in a human heart,

03:32.385 --> 03:34.905
it can awaken the host's hidden potential,

03:36.065 --> 03:38.025
but at the cost of their lifespan.

03:38.985 --> 03:40.345
If the host dies,

03:40.425 --> 03:43.105
Moon-Eclipse is left hanging by a thread.

03:43.745 --> 03:46.145
Only by returning to Wanwei Herb

03:46.225 --> 03:48.025
can it breed and survive.

03:52.585 --> 03:55.665
Li Hongqing oversaw Master's burial
back then.

03:56.185 --> 03:58.345
If I want to untangle
what really happened in the palace,

03:59.065 --> 04:01.145
it seems I must first reclaim
the Phoenix Seal.

04:04.585 --> 04:07.345
LINGHE HALL

04:07.425 --> 04:08.785
While I was away,

04:08.865 --> 04:10.945
has anything interesting happened
in the palace?

04:11.705 --> 04:13.105
I wouldn't dare to say.

04:13.625 --> 04:14.905
You wouldn't dare?

04:14.985 --> 04:16.425
That only makes me want to hear it more.

04:16.944 --> 04:19.305
Then Your Majesty mustn't get angry.

04:21.184 --> 04:22.305
I won't. Speak.

04:23.065 --> 04:25.305
I've heard
the Empress Dowager has lately been busy

04:25.385 --> 04:26.945
choosing consorts for His Majesty.

04:33.985 --> 04:35.185
What a "good" thing.

04:35.865 --> 04:37.745
How is that good?

04:37.825 --> 04:40.625
Have you forgotten how the Empress Dowager
used to make things so hard for you?

04:40.705 --> 04:42.905
Of course it's good. Come on.

04:45.865 --> 04:48.225
Greetings, Mother.

04:50.585 --> 04:52.225
Have you ever

04:52.305 --> 04:54.385
seen me as your Mother at all?

04:55.065 --> 04:56.185
What do you mean by that, Mother?

04:56.825 --> 04:58.465
Even now,

04:58.545 --> 05:00.105
you still play dumb with me?

05:02.545 --> 05:05.385
Mother, I truly don't know.

05:06.025 --> 05:07.425
As Empress,

05:07.505 --> 05:09.825
you've been in the palace so long
without His Majesty's favor,

05:09.905 --> 05:11.825
with no hope of heirs.

05:12.745 --> 05:16.625
I want to choose concubines
for His Majesty,

05:17.145 --> 05:20.825
yet he keeps saying
he must discuss it with you.

05:21.665 --> 05:22.505
What,

05:23.025 --> 05:24.985
you don't want him to take concubines?

05:26.665 --> 05:27.905
Mother, please understand.

05:27.985 --> 05:30.545
I've only just returned to the palace
and only just heard of this.

05:30.625 --> 05:33.105
So, now you know that?

05:38.065 --> 05:38.985
Yes.

05:39.065 --> 05:40.465
Rest assured, Mother,

05:40.545 --> 05:42.825
I'll help you persuade His Majesty

05:42.905 --> 05:44.745
to take more consorts

05:44.825 --> 05:47.185
and give the royal family heirs.

05:49.265 --> 05:50.105
Really?

05:51.585 --> 05:53.065
Absolutely.

05:58.545 --> 05:59.425
Your Majesty,

05:59.505 --> 06:01.465
these are ladies of the right age

06:01.545 --> 06:03.265
the Empress Dowager and I
have carefully chosen for you.

06:03.945 --> 06:06.305
They're all from respectable families
and outstanding in looks.

06:06.385 --> 06:07.785
Please look them over.

06:09.705 --> 06:10.865
You want to pick consorts for me?

06:11.465 --> 06:12.905
-Exactly.
-Why?

06:14.065 --> 06:16.545
You sit on the throne above all
and should expand the harem

06:16.625 --> 06:17.985
to carry on the royal line.

06:19.105 --> 06:21.185
Do you even hear yourself?

06:22.785 --> 06:25.705
As Empress, it's only right
that I help the Empress Dowager

06:25.785 --> 06:27.105
manage the inner palace.

06:27.185 --> 06:28.105
That's my duty.

06:28.185 --> 06:30.705
Must you talk to me like this?

06:32.465 --> 06:33.465
Please take your time choosing.

06:33.545 --> 06:35.065
I'll take my leave.

06:37.745 --> 06:40.425
Do you realize
the Empress Dowager is doing this

06:40.505 --> 06:43.745
to plant her own spies at my side?

06:46.785 --> 06:48.785
There's no real affection
in this palace anyway.

06:48.865 --> 06:50.945
Spy or not, what difference does it make?

06:57.865 --> 06:58.905
All right.

06:58.985 --> 07:00.025
If that's how it is,

07:00.105 --> 07:01.665
I'll take my time and choose carefully.

07:03.585 --> 07:04.625
As you wish.

07:04.705 --> 07:09.545
PURE AND SPOTLESS

07:11.225 --> 07:12.665
Please don't be angry, Your Majesty.

07:12.745 --> 07:15.305
Her Majesty must have been pressed
by the Empress Dowager.

07:16.065 --> 07:19.225
Have Li Hongqing look into every detail
about these noble ladies.

07:19.825 --> 07:22.545
I want to know everything,
down to the smallest thing.

07:23.105 --> 07:23.945
Yes, Your Majesty.

07:41.905 --> 07:43.065
Your Majesty,

07:43.665 --> 07:45.065
please don't be upset.

07:45.785 --> 07:47.145
What would I be upset about?

07:47.225 --> 07:50.025
I've heard His Majesty
chose Minister Xing's daughter

07:50.105 --> 07:51.745
and plans to make her Noble Consort,

07:51.825 --> 07:54.105
showering her with gifts every day.

07:54.625 --> 07:55.785
Minister Xing's daughter?

07:56.545 --> 07:58.465
They say, at court,

07:58.545 --> 08:01.305
Minister Xing and the Grand Tutor

08:01.385 --> 08:02.905
have never really seen eye to eye.

08:02.985 --> 08:05.105
It doesn't matter.
As long as His Majesty is pleased.

08:05.745 --> 08:07.705
Miss Xing Yiyi is gentle and sweet,

08:07.785 --> 08:08.865
graceful and charming.

08:08.945 --> 08:10.385
I like her very much.

08:10.945 --> 08:13.705
What title
do you think I should grant her?

08:14.305 --> 08:16.585
Since Your Majesty likes her,
you can decide that yourself.

08:17.905 --> 08:21.065
I like her gentleness
and I like her grace.

08:22.305 --> 08:25.425
Should I name her Consort Rou,
or Consort Wan instead?

08:26.185 --> 08:27.625
If you like her that much…

08:30.305 --> 08:33.784
how about
I just give her the Empress's seat?

08:36.024 --> 08:37.705
You're quite mistaken.

08:37.784 --> 08:41.024
The Empress's duty is to run the harem,
an exhausting task.

08:41.105 --> 08:43.865
How could I bear to let Miss Xing Yiyi
work herself so hard?

08:49.745 --> 08:51.505
My dear, you're in a bad mood?

08:55.025 --> 08:55.905
No need for you to worry.

08:55.985 --> 08:58.945
If you're in a bad mood,
you could simply say so.

08:59.025 --> 08:59.945
I won't take her in, then.

09:00.665 --> 09:02.585
Don't you dare.
You should take her in quickly.

09:02.665 --> 09:04.705
I still have a pile of harem affairs
to manage

09:04.785 --> 09:06.185
and won't stay here to witness your bliss.

09:12.265 --> 09:13.225
Cangcang,

09:14.065 --> 09:15.345
you do care about me after all.

09:26.065 --> 09:27.785
His Majesty chose Yiyi.

09:29.785 --> 09:31.105
He really chose Yiyi?

09:31.825 --> 09:33.305
Would I lie about that?

09:33.385 --> 09:35.625
That Empress was furious.

09:47.465 --> 09:49.065
This Xiao Huan…

09:50.785 --> 09:53.385
I understand him less and less.

09:53.465 --> 09:56.225
Perhaps His Majesty is simply tired
of that Ling father and daughter

09:56.305 --> 09:57.345
and wants to lean toward your side.

09:58.225 --> 09:59.705
Not necessarily.

10:00.905 --> 10:03.185
The Empress has always
loved blades and spears,

10:03.265 --> 10:04.665
headstrong and domineering.

10:05.225 --> 10:08.785
Maybe it's Yiyi's gentle, sweet nature

10:08.865 --> 10:10.385
that Xiao Huan favors more.

10:12.505 --> 10:14.025
Whatever the reason,

10:14.545 --> 10:15.785
it's a good thing in the end.

10:18.465 --> 10:20.185
Ling Cangcang really thinks

10:21.145 --> 10:24.345
I don't see she's using this

10:24.425 --> 10:25.985
to reclaim the Phoenix Seal?

10:27.785 --> 10:30.185
She's digging her own grave.

10:40.145 --> 10:42.265
Your Majesty, please don't be angry.

10:42.865 --> 10:44.385
Who says I'm angry?

10:44.985 --> 10:48.585
They say Miss Xing excels
in every refined art,

10:48.665 --> 10:50.305
with a slim waist, long legs,
and gifted in song and dance.

10:50.385 --> 10:52.705
If she really enters the palace,
Your Majesty would…

10:59.105 --> 11:02.105
In a few days, it'll be the Lotus Banquet
the Empress Dowager ordered.

11:02.185 --> 11:04.945
They say she'll be granted a title
at the Lotus Banquet.

11:07.625 --> 11:08.705
Xiaoshan,

11:10.545 --> 11:14.105
go inform the Empress Dowager
that I've caught a chill,

11:14.185 --> 11:16.305
and can't help her host the Lotus Banquet.

11:16.385 --> 11:17.465
And also…

11:17.545 --> 11:18.585
Come here.

11:26.345 --> 11:27.385
Yes, Your Majesty.

12:17.225 --> 12:20.065
Minister Xing,
your daughter is truly striking in looks.

12:24.305 --> 12:27.745
My dear, what do you think
of Miss Yiyi's dancing?

12:31.545 --> 12:32.665
Very good.

12:33.505 --> 12:36.025
If Miss Yiyi enters the palace one day,

12:36.105 --> 12:38.385
let her dance for us every day.

12:38.465 --> 12:39.505
How about that?

12:40.465 --> 12:41.905
You may enjoy that by yourself.

12:41.985 --> 12:43.225
After all,

12:43.305 --> 12:45.545
I've always liked blades and spears.

12:45.625 --> 12:47.705
If I were to hurt Miss Yiyi by accident,
that would be awful.

13:16.905 --> 13:20.225
Yiyi really is beautifully made,

13:20.305 --> 13:22.345
talented and accomplished.

13:22.945 --> 13:24.945
What do you say, Cangcang?

13:26.025 --> 13:27.625
You're absolutely right.

13:27.705 --> 13:30.585
Why don't we
let Miss Yiyi enter the palace sooner,

13:30.665 --> 13:32.185
so she can keep His Majesty company
more often.

13:33.825 --> 13:35.065
Minister Xing.

13:36.305 --> 13:38.385
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Are you willing to part with her?

13:40.105 --> 13:42.905
For Yiyi to receive Your Majesty's favor

13:42.985 --> 13:44.505
is fortune beyond three lifetimes.

13:45.305 --> 13:47.265
How would I dare say I'm unwilling?

13:48.425 --> 13:51.585
In that case, there's no day like today.

13:52.185 --> 13:54.585
Yiyi will stay in the palace tonight.

13:55.825 --> 13:56.665
Wait!

14:01.625 --> 14:02.665
Wait!

14:08.385 --> 14:09.945
Who are you, daring to make a scene here?

14:11.185 --> 14:12.025
I…

14:12.105 --> 14:13.705
Yiyi and I already made a lifelong vow.

14:14.305 --> 14:16.745
How outrageously bold…

14:18.025 --> 14:21.905
Insolent wretch!
Who sent you to slander my daughter?

14:23.705 --> 14:25.785
Your Majesty,
Your Majesty the Empress Dowager, I…

14:26.785 --> 14:28.465
I don't even know this man!

14:28.545 --> 14:29.585
Yiyi,

14:29.665 --> 14:31.025
how can you be so heartless?

14:31.105 --> 14:34.345
Which one of the skills you have
wasn't taught by me?

14:34.945 --> 14:35.785
Shut up!

14:38.265 --> 14:39.105
Your Majesty,

14:40.265 --> 14:42.505
this is the Noble Consort
you chose so carefully?

14:49.945 --> 14:50.985
Please, calm your anger.

14:51.505 --> 14:53.265
Mother must have been overwhelmed
by all the harem affairs.

14:53.345 --> 14:56.465
It's my fault too
for not easing her burdens sooner.

14:57.105 --> 14:57.945
Your Majesty,

14:58.025 --> 15:01.025
you've worked so hard
running the inner palace all these years.

15:01.545 --> 15:03.625
Why not leave these matters
to the Empress?

15:04.745 --> 15:06.665
At your age,

15:06.745 --> 15:08.585
you deserve some peace and rest.

15:13.585 --> 15:16.025
Your Majesty the Empress Dowager,
please spare me!

15:16.105 --> 15:17.785
I'll do everything you say from now on.

15:29.265 --> 15:30.505
At court this morning,

15:30.585 --> 15:32.305
Grand Tutor Ling
and others submitted memorials,

15:32.385 --> 15:35.585
saying a man slipped
into the royal banquet

15:35.665 --> 15:37.785
and that you failed in your oversight.

15:40.505 --> 15:44.505
Since Xing Yiyi
was your personal recommendation,

15:44.585 --> 15:46.465
with her conduct in question
and her dignity lost before all,

15:47.185 --> 15:48.785
you cannot escape blame.

15:50.545 --> 15:51.385
And…

15:52.545 --> 15:54.305
Why are you stammering? Speak!

15:54.985 --> 15:56.985
Minister Xing had impeached you as well.

16:00.945 --> 16:02.945
Talk about everyone kicking you
when you're down.

16:03.665 --> 16:06.225
He's just trying to wash his hands clean.

16:06.745 --> 16:08.265
That old fox.

16:08.345 --> 16:10.345
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

16:10.425 --> 16:11.585
His Majesty has decreed today

16:11.665 --> 16:13.465
that the Phoenix Seal be placed
in the Empress's care.

16:13.545 --> 16:14.385
They…

16:14.465 --> 16:16.265
they've already taken
the Phoenix Seal away.

16:16.345 --> 16:17.185
What?

16:24.745 --> 16:26.665
Satisfied now, my dear?

16:29.105 --> 16:31.745
You knew my plan from the start,
that's why you chose Xing Yiyi?

16:31.825 --> 16:33.025
What else?

16:33.545 --> 16:35.745
Did you really think I actually liked her?

16:36.905 --> 16:39.785
Whether you like her is your business,
nothing to do with me.

16:43.545 --> 16:46.745
I had every candidate's background
thoroughly checked

16:46.825 --> 16:48.065
before settling on Xing Yiyi.

16:48.145 --> 16:50.385
Even if you hadn't picked her,
I had other ways.

16:51.505 --> 16:52.345
Oh?

16:52.865 --> 16:53.705
What ways?

16:53.785 --> 16:56.185
All the names I handed you
were filtered by me,

16:56.265 --> 16:57.425
each with their own issues.

16:58.825 --> 17:00.105
So you're saying

17:00.625 --> 17:02.865
you never meant to choose consorts
for me at all?

17:05.464 --> 17:06.905
Whether you take consorts isn't the point.

17:07.625 --> 17:08.745
What matters is

17:10.585 --> 17:12.184
I've finally got the Phoenix Seal.

17:20.865 --> 17:22.305
You care that much about the Phoenix Seal?

17:27.585 --> 17:29.025
Only with it in my hand

17:30.225 --> 17:31.665
can I do what I need to do.

17:40.825 --> 17:42.985
Your Majesty, please save me!

17:43.065 --> 17:44.505
I'm…

17:45.585 --> 17:47.025
I'm already carrying a child.

17:48.425 --> 17:50.105
You're carrying a child

17:50.185 --> 17:51.625
and still dare to dream of marrying
into the throne?

17:52.225 --> 17:54.145
You insisted I enter the palace.

17:54.225 --> 17:55.825
You said back then

17:56.385 --> 17:58.505
if I came in to spy
on His Majesty for you,

17:59.745 --> 18:02.185
you'd see the Xing clan
rise high and smooth.

18:02.785 --> 18:06.225
That still doesn't excuse you
for such deceit and betrayal!

18:07.985 --> 18:09.225
Please, calm your anger.

18:09.865 --> 18:12.505
It was all my negligence.
Please punish me instead.

18:13.545 --> 18:14.385
Get up.

18:15.225 --> 18:18.185
At this point, blame won't help us.

18:19.785 --> 18:20.825
It's all my fault

18:20.905 --> 18:23.505
for underestimating that Ling Cangcang.

18:23.585 --> 18:24.425
You're right.

18:26.145 --> 18:26.985
Miss Xing,

18:28.105 --> 18:29.305
we were all tricked by the Empress.

18:30.185 --> 18:32.865
She only ever meant to use you
to snatch back the Phoenix Seal.

18:33.385 --> 18:35.705
She let Zhou slip in too.

18:36.225 --> 18:37.065
She's the one

18:37.745 --> 18:39.545
who drove you to this state.

18:47.785 --> 18:49.385
The Empress Dowager spared your life

18:50.505 --> 18:53.225
so you could seize this last chance.

18:53.945 --> 18:55.105
An eye for an eye,

18:56.065 --> 18:57.705
a tooth for a tooth.

18:58.425 --> 19:00.625
Make the one who ruined you

19:01.265 --> 19:02.825
pay the price.

19:09.265 --> 19:10.265
Child,

19:10.945 --> 19:13.625
don't let me down again.

19:33.985 --> 19:37.825
LINGHE HALL

19:43.545 --> 19:47.305
Your Majesty, all the Lingbi Sect files
are stored in the Inner Archive.

19:58.985 --> 20:00.065
Let's go.

20:00.145 --> 20:04.425
INNER ARCHIVE

20:25.545 --> 20:26.705
Greetings, Your Majesty.

20:37.785 --> 20:38.865
Your Majesty,

20:38.945 --> 20:41.705
there are over
eighty thousand dossiers here.

20:41.785 --> 20:44.665
What you seek
really won't be easy to find.

20:46.345 --> 20:47.385
Are you trying

20:47.465 --> 20:48.825
to mislead me?

20:51.385 --> 20:53.345
Forgive me, Your Majesty. I wouldn't dare!

20:53.425 --> 20:55.225
Then you'd better talk fast.

20:55.305 --> 20:57.785
If I report to His Majesty
that you offended me,

20:57.865 --> 21:00.105
I can't guarantee you'll like the outcome.

21:01.505 --> 21:02.745
Please, don't be angry!

21:02.825 --> 21:03.665
In answer to Your Majesty,

21:03.745 --> 21:06.265
Commander Li came here yesterday

21:06.905 --> 21:08.305
and took the dossiers.

21:08.385 --> 21:10.785
He also took a…

21:10.865 --> 21:11.985
a coffin.

21:13.465 --> 21:14.505
A coffin…

21:16.665 --> 21:20.585
INNER ARCHIVE

21:33.785 --> 21:34.865
Your Majesty,

21:34.945 --> 21:37.545
shall we return to Linghe Hall?

21:38.105 --> 21:39.985
You may go back first.
I'll walk by myself for a while.

21:41.345 --> 21:42.425
Yes, Your Majesty.

21:48.465 --> 21:49.945
Xiao Huan must have known

21:50.025 --> 21:52.945
I'd use the Phoenix Seal
to enter the Inner Archive.

21:53.465 --> 21:55.305
So he moved what I wanted ahead of time.

21:56.785 --> 21:58.145
And that thing

21:58.985 --> 22:00.385
is a coffin.

22:00.945 --> 22:03.065
Moon-Eclipse is the Ghost King's token

22:03.145 --> 22:04.705
and can be planted in a human heart.

22:05.225 --> 22:06.585
Perhaps, Master's body

22:08.505 --> 22:10.145
lies in that coffin,

22:12.545 --> 22:13.665
with Moon-Eclipse

22:15.185 --> 22:17.025
still inside him?

22:18.865 --> 22:19.745
What's wrong, Master?

22:22.465 --> 22:24.065
The Ghost King is dangerous.

22:24.665 --> 22:25.985
That Ghost King's
committed countless atrocities

22:26.065 --> 22:27.385
and harmed so many people.

22:27.465 --> 22:29.545
None of this
is something you should meddle in.

22:30.425 --> 22:31.545
Remember this:

22:32.145 --> 22:33.545
in this world,

22:33.625 --> 22:35.585
the only one who's wholly good to you

22:35.665 --> 22:36.945
is your father.

22:37.465 --> 22:40.105
Even I, your master,
you mustn't trust completely.

22:41.905 --> 22:42.865
Master…

22:45.065 --> 22:46.545
are you really the Ghost King?

23:02.905 --> 23:03.945
No way…

23:07.305 --> 23:08.465
That's impossible.

23:15.425 --> 23:17.145
-It was you.
-I'll kill you!

23:17.225 --> 23:18.385
Listen.

23:18.905 --> 23:21.945
Before you ever entered the palace,
I'd already planned a way out for you.

23:22.025 --> 23:23.425
You can choose to stay,

23:23.505 --> 23:26.065
or I can send you out of the palace

23:26.145 --> 23:27.985
to live freely with the man you love.

23:28.505 --> 23:30.425
-Really?
-Of course.

23:30.505 --> 23:31.945
That was part of my plan all along.

23:33.105 --> 23:34.265
Now that I hold the Phoenix Seal,

23:34.345 --> 23:36.465
one decree from me
and no one will dare stop you leaving.

23:51.265 --> 23:53.745
They will never let you
walk out of here alive.

23:56.065 --> 23:57.185
Why not?

23:57.945 --> 23:59.025
Because

24:00.785 --> 24:01.745
they

24:03.345 --> 24:04.425
want you dead!

24:26.625 --> 24:27.665
That useless girl,

24:28.185 --> 24:31.185
good for nothing and only making trouble.

24:31.265 --> 24:32.425
Please, calm your anger.

24:32.505 --> 24:34.225
At least Xing Yiyi had the sense

24:34.305 --> 24:35.385
to die at the Empress's hand.

24:37.465 --> 24:39.145
Send word to Minister Xing

24:39.225 --> 24:41.545
that the Empress punished Xing Yiyi
for disrupting the harem

24:41.625 --> 24:43.105
and had her tortured to death.

24:43.185 --> 24:44.265
Yes, Your Majesty.

24:49.785 --> 24:53.745
Ling Cangcang, you little brat,

24:53.825 --> 24:55.865
how could you ever be a match for me?

24:57.265 --> 25:00.105
We'll see who comes to save you this time.

25:07.305 --> 25:09.945
WUYING HALL

25:18.585 --> 25:19.625
Your Majesty,

25:20.465 --> 25:21.545
Minister Xing is kneeling
outside the hall,

25:21.625 --> 25:23.385
saying Xing Yiyi died miserably
in the palace.

25:23.465 --> 25:24.945
He begs Your Majesty to clear her name.

25:27.945 --> 25:29.265
Send him back.

25:29.785 --> 25:31.985
Tell him I'll handle it.

25:32.945 --> 25:33.865
Yes, Your Majesty.

25:42.905 --> 25:46.105
They will never let you
walk out of here alive.

25:46.185 --> 25:47.225
They

25:48.785 --> 25:50.145
want you dead!

25:57.065 --> 25:59.185
Your Majesty, Eunuch Feng is here.

26:00.425 --> 26:02.945
Greetings, Your Majesty.

26:03.025 --> 26:04.105
I bear an oral decree from His Majesty.

26:04.185 --> 26:07.385
His Majesty asks you to hand
over the Phoenix Seal.

26:09.665 --> 26:12.105
What? Hand over the Phoenix Seal?

26:12.745 --> 26:15.505
I'm only here to pass
on His Majesty's words.

26:18.745 --> 26:22.185
PURE AND SPOTLESS

26:26.265 --> 26:27.385
Why must I hand over the Phoenix Seal?

26:29.545 --> 26:30.505
Do you know

26:31.625 --> 26:33.865
that these
are all memorials impeaching you?

26:34.465 --> 26:36.505
This was all arranged
by the Empress Dowager.

26:37.105 --> 26:40.025
She ordered Xing Yiyi to kill me,
never intending to let her live.

26:40.665 --> 26:42.945
-I'm well aware of that.
-And you still do this?

26:43.545 --> 26:45.825
This is the palace, not the martial world.

26:46.545 --> 26:48.185
The palace is an arena of power,

26:48.265 --> 26:50.065
not a place for weighing right and wrong.

26:50.665 --> 26:52.465
So Xing Yiyi dies
without the truth, just like that?

26:54.145 --> 26:55.705
Is a human life

26:56.665 --> 26:58.105
nothing more than a tool
to seize the Phoenix Seal?

27:00.945 --> 27:02.305
Hand over the Phoenix Seal first.

27:02.825 --> 27:05.625
When this blows over,
I'll give it back to you.

27:07.185 --> 27:08.825
You want me to hand it over

27:09.345 --> 27:10.585
because they've impeached me,

27:11.265 --> 27:12.305
or you can't bear me

27:13.385 --> 27:14.825
walking freely through the palace

27:15.345 --> 27:16.345
with the Phoenix Seal?

27:17.745 --> 27:18.665
What are you implying?

27:19.265 --> 27:20.345
You know very well.

27:24.425 --> 27:27.425
I did move your master's body.

27:27.505 --> 27:28.785
I didn't want you to find it.

27:28.865 --> 27:30.425
But it was also because

27:30.945 --> 27:33.345
I didn't want you dragged into this.

27:35.865 --> 27:37.345
My Begonia Pendant glows

27:37.865 --> 27:39.385
whenever it's near poison.

27:39.945 --> 27:42.585
When it was close to my master's body,
it glowed.

27:43.185 --> 27:44.985
Is it because his body

27:46.905 --> 27:47.785
was hiding Moon-Eclipse?

27:54.505 --> 27:56.265
Did you already know

27:57.465 --> 27:58.865
he was the Ghost King,

28:00.665 --> 28:01.665
and kill him for that?

28:03.265 --> 28:04.265
Cangcang,

28:05.665 --> 28:08.425
there was more to your master
than just being the Ghost King.

28:08.505 --> 28:10.625
So moving his body

28:11.865 --> 28:14.705
was also to stop Moon-Eclipse
from harming the world?

28:16.185 --> 28:17.025
Is that it?

28:21.385 --> 28:22.345
Answer me.

28:32.705 --> 28:35.545
-I gave your master my word.
-He had no right to decide for me!

28:38.345 --> 28:39.505
And neither do you.

28:48.505 --> 28:49.425
Fine.

28:50.745 --> 28:51.865
I'll take you somewhere now.

30:19.225 --> 30:21.505
Master… Master…

30:25.225 --> 30:27.305
Yes. It's your master.

30:30.425 --> 30:31.905
It's my master.

30:55.185 --> 30:56.065
Master…

30:58.385 --> 30:59.785
Why did you lie to me?

31:03.305 --> 31:04.665
Why?

31:06.385 --> 31:08.705
Why are you the Ghost King?

31:13.905 --> 31:14.745
Cangcang,

31:16.505 --> 31:19.145
I killed him because I had no choice.

31:26.785 --> 31:28.905
Because he was the Ghost King,

31:31.825 --> 31:33.105
that was

31:34.985 --> 31:37.145
why you approached me from the start,

31:38.425 --> 31:39.745
used me

31:41.705 --> 31:43.185
and lied to me?

32:01.905 --> 32:03.585
You say you had no choice,

32:04.985 --> 32:07.145
tossing out those few words so lightly.

32:08.505 --> 32:09.905
But do you know

32:11.345 --> 32:12.825
that I've endured

32:13.785 --> 32:14.905
this heart-rending pain,

32:15.425 --> 32:16.745
day and night,

32:17.465 --> 32:19.105
with no relief at all?

32:22.025 --> 32:23.865
Do you think I don't hurt too?

32:26.345 --> 32:27.625
You hurt?

32:30.665 --> 32:32.785
Every time I see you sad and in pain,

32:33.785 --> 32:36.785
see you misunderstanding me, hating me,

32:37.305 --> 32:38.625
it hurts every time.

32:40.425 --> 32:41.465
Cangcang,

32:42.945 --> 32:44.625
in this position,

32:45.265 --> 32:47.905
I truly have no say most of the time.

32:49.905 --> 32:51.505
Then keep hurting.

32:52.905 --> 32:54.305
And let me go on hating you.

32:58.185 --> 32:59.505
You're the one

33:00.345 --> 33:01.945
who, from the very start,

33:02.505 --> 33:04.625
only ever lied to me and used me.

33:05.945 --> 33:06.825
Cangcang,

33:07.625 --> 33:09.305
I've always been sincere with you.

33:12.225 --> 33:13.225
Sincere?

33:16.785 --> 33:18.305
What counts as sincerity?

33:20.145 --> 33:21.505
Even Master

33:23.385 --> 33:25.105
I was closest to and trusted most

33:26.305 --> 33:27.625
was lying to me.

33:34.065 --> 33:35.745
In this world,

33:38.585 --> 33:40.545
who else can I trust?

33:48.665 --> 33:49.705
Master,

33:51.345 --> 33:52.625
tell me…

33:54.305 --> 33:55.905
in this world,

33:59.905 --> 34:02.385
who can I still believe in?

34:11.225 --> 34:12.905
Tell your disciple,

34:14.344 --> 34:15.264
who

34:17.105 --> 34:19.105
can I still trust?

34:44.425 --> 34:45.505
Cangcang,

34:47.145 --> 34:50.065
believe it or not, it's up to you.

34:51.385 --> 34:52.425
But I will spend this life

34:53.665 --> 34:56.225
giving everything to shield you

34:57.225 --> 34:58.985
and keep you safe and sound.

35:11.025 --> 35:13.785
Father, Cangcang saw Li Lu's body.

35:13.865 --> 35:16.105
It seems Moon-Eclipse is still in him.

35:16.785 --> 35:19.625
Other than that,
what else did Cangcang find?

35:20.385 --> 35:21.225
I don't know.

35:22.425 --> 35:23.945
Sound Cangcang out for me.

35:24.025 --> 35:26.865
Find out how far she's gotten

35:27.465 --> 35:29.345
with Li Lu's case.

35:30.585 --> 35:31.425
Understood.

35:36.145 --> 35:37.065
Your Majesty.

35:41.465 --> 35:42.505
You may go.

35:47.945 --> 35:48.985
Your Majesty,

35:49.505 --> 35:50.825
Heaven rewards the diligent.

35:51.425 --> 35:54.105
Our people have finally caught something
on the Empress.

36:05.185 --> 36:07.025
CHANGYUE TAVERN

36:17.465 --> 36:20.785
XIJIANG MOON

36:24.425 --> 36:25.465
Cangcang.

36:31.385 --> 36:34.785
Cangcang, why not meet at the Ling Manor?

36:35.385 --> 36:36.945
Did he forbid you to go home?

36:39.225 --> 36:40.825
I just don't want to worry Father.

36:44.425 --> 36:45.385
Have a seat now.

36:56.665 --> 36:57.665
Master

36:58.545 --> 36:59.465
really was the Ghost King.

37:03.745 --> 37:05.105
If that's true,

37:05.185 --> 37:07.105
then the Sword Cottage incident
wasn't a frame-up.

37:12.265 --> 37:13.105
Are you sure?

37:14.985 --> 37:16.945
I saw Master's body.

37:17.945 --> 37:19.985
Moon-Eclipse really is inside him.

37:20.065 --> 37:22.505
So Xiao Huan hid the body

37:23.025 --> 37:23.865
because of Moon-Eclipse.

37:24.585 --> 37:27.385
He only didn't want it
falling into the wrong hands.

37:27.465 --> 37:30.145
Cangcang,
how can you take his word for it?

37:30.665 --> 37:32.865
If you ask me,
you still need to find a way

37:32.945 --> 37:34.705
to get Moon-Eclipse in your own hands.

37:35.665 --> 37:37.465
If that booklet is telling the truth,

37:38.145 --> 37:40.065
then in your pendant is Wanwei Herb,

37:40.945 --> 37:42.785
the perfect vessel for Moon-Eclipse.

37:48.465 --> 37:49.545
Cangcang,

37:49.625 --> 37:51.785
this concerns the lives
of people across the land.

37:51.865 --> 37:52.905
You must think it through.

37:57.625 --> 38:00.345
You mean he covets Moon-Eclipse,

38:00.945 --> 38:02.585
-rather than…?
-Cangcang,

38:03.225 --> 38:04.785
just because Mr. Li Lu is the Ghost King,

38:05.465 --> 38:07.145
you're going to forgive him again?

38:10.345 --> 38:11.385
I'm not.

38:13.505 --> 38:15.625
I have thought he might have had no choice
about killing Master,

38:17.105 --> 38:18.545
but lying to me

38:18.625 --> 38:22.345
and using me to get close to Master,
that was his own choice.

38:24.345 --> 38:25.185
I…

38:28.025 --> 38:29.305
I don't know…

38:30.465 --> 38:32.345
I don't know who I can trust anymore.

38:33.705 --> 38:35.665
Even Master lied to me.

38:37.505 --> 38:38.825
Can I trust you?

38:41.745 --> 38:43.985
You've never lied to me, right, Luo?

38:53.825 --> 38:54.905
Of course not.

38:55.505 --> 38:57.905
Cangcang, have you forgotten?

38:58.505 --> 39:00.905
My life was saved by you and Father.

39:01.425 --> 39:02.825
How could I ever lie to you?

39:10.305 --> 39:11.585
How is Father?

39:13.185 --> 39:16.585
Aside from worrying
that you're being bullied in the palace,

39:16.665 --> 39:17.785
he's fine.

39:23.105 --> 39:25.145
At least I still have you and Father.

39:33.705 --> 39:34.825
Cangcang,

39:34.905 --> 39:36.385
even if Father keeps saying

39:36.465 --> 39:38.145
you should hold tight
to the Empress's seat,

39:38.225 --> 39:39.865
you must think it through.

39:40.865 --> 39:43.345
Remember how he tricked you
in Southern Chu and used you.

39:44.305 --> 39:46.185
Don't let him cloud your judgment again.

39:51.265 --> 39:53.425
-Here we are! Come with me!
-Yes!

39:58.265 --> 39:59.545
Find them!

40:02.905 --> 40:04.025
Officers…

40:04.945 --> 40:06.025
Aunt Chan?

40:06.905 --> 40:09.025
Palace guards on royal orders!

40:10.385 --> 40:11.985
How did she find this place?

40:24.585 --> 40:25.545
Your Majesty,

40:25.625 --> 40:27.705
the Empress Dowager
heard you left the palace without leave

40:28.305 --> 40:31.385
and sent this maid
to remind you of the rules.

40:36.345 --> 40:38.105
I brought the Empress out to drink tea.

40:39.065 --> 40:41.905
Do I now need
the Empress Dowager's permission as well?

40:44.745 --> 40:47.185
This maid deserves death!
This maid deserves death!

40:47.785 --> 40:50.945
For disturbing our pleasant outing,
you certainly do.

40:52.305 --> 40:53.625
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

40:53.705 --> 40:55.225
-Forgive me, Your Majesty…
-Get lost!

40:55.745 --> 40:57.305
I'll deal with your offense back
at the palace.

40:57.385 --> 40:58.345
Yes, Your Majesty.

41:25.985 --> 41:27.305
Why did you come here?

41:29.265 --> 41:31.905
I heard Aunt Chan had brought guards here

41:31.985 --> 41:33.745
and came out of curiosity.

41:33.825 --> 41:35.665
I didn't expect to run into you.

41:38.105 --> 41:40.825
Their tea and snacks are good.
I came to try them.

41:45.985 --> 41:47.705
Drinking tea alone,

41:47.785 --> 41:48.945
yet two cups on the table?

41:52.105 --> 41:54.505
Since you know I'm not here alone,

41:54.585 --> 41:55.545
why cover for me?

41:57.945 --> 42:00.625
I told you I'd keep you safe.

42:11.545 --> 42:13.785
Since I'm rarely
out of the palace incognito,

42:14.505 --> 42:17.105
why not stroll around with me?

42:21.185 --> 42:22.665
Watch this!

42:26.505 --> 42:28.305
Look at that!

42:29.905 --> 42:31.385
Lanterns!

42:31.905 --> 42:33.345
Lanterns!

42:34.065 --> 42:34.905
Take a look, miss.

42:40.065 --> 42:40.985
Fireworks!

42:42.105 --> 42:45.385
Honey puffs! Fresh honey puffs!

42:45.465 --> 42:48.145
Try before you buy! Cheap and tasty!

42:48.225 --> 42:51.025
These are from our Yuan family,
made with our secret recipe!

42:51.105 --> 42:52.305
Come have a taste!

42:52.385 --> 42:53.865
Honey puffs!

42:53.945 --> 42:55.425
Come on, sir, have a bite!

42:55.505 --> 42:56.385
YUAN'S HONEY CAKE SHOP

42:56.465 --> 42:58.625
Sir, one serving of honey puffs.

42:58.705 --> 43:00.145
-Got it.
-Pack one piece separately for me.

43:00.225 --> 43:01.145
Sure.

43:03.585 --> 43:04.785
-Please try it.
-All right.

43:06.345 --> 43:07.465
Come catch me!

43:07.545 --> 43:09.145
Here. Have a taste.

43:13.825 --> 43:16.025
All right. Thank you.

43:16.105 --> 43:18.025
-You're too kind, sir.
-So sweet.

43:20.185 --> 43:22.145
This was my favorite treat as a child.

43:23.465 --> 43:24.505
Why?

43:26.745 --> 43:28.585
I had a cold sickness growing up.

43:29.665 --> 43:31.225
When my mother was alive,

43:31.305 --> 43:34.105
every time she gave me medicine,
she'd give me a piece of honey puff too.

43:34.785 --> 43:35.945
No matter how bitter the medicine was,

43:36.465 --> 43:40.065
as long as there was honey puff,
all I could taste was sweetness.

43:41.105 --> 43:44.185
But I've hardly ever seen it
in the palace.

43:45.985 --> 43:49.145
After my mother died, I swore off sweets.

43:49.225 --> 43:51.985
I wanted to remember that bitterness

43:52.065 --> 43:54.665
and remind myself never to slack off.

43:56.545 --> 43:57.785
But later,

43:57.865 --> 43:59.425
when I tasted your pear blossom honey,

43:59.505 --> 44:00.585
I realized

44:00.665 --> 44:03.665
sweetness still beats bitterness
after all.
